# guard-tags — a tag-guarded reservation (information-flow). A cross_border action
# is reserved to the DPO only when the token carries the declared, non-id tag
# `non_eu`. Membership over a declared category, not branching on identity.
actor a
human dpo role dpo
gate g1 risk high grant a
gate g2 risk high grant a
reserve cross_border by dpo when tags contains non_eu
cord a -> g1
cord a -> g2
cord g1 -> master
cord g2 -> master
